  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Extractive Industry Governance</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Gobernanza de la industria extractiva</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El prop&#xf3;sito de este acuerdo de cooperaci&#xf3;n es mejorar la gobernanza en el sector extractivo en el Per&#xfa; y aumentar su contribuci&#xf3;n a las inversiones social y ambientalmente sostenibles.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this cooperative agreement is to improve governance in the extractive sector in peru and increase its contribution to socially and environmentally sustainable investments.</narrative>
  </description>
